  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"3880374e-c73d-4318-b6e8-82ba49c3413d"],
 " is the transpose: it swaps inputs and outputs while preserving port \
direction. Compare with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["DiagramDual",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/DiagrammaticComputation/ref/DiagramDual"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"4fb6c2fe-d984-4cc4-8cd9-b3150d6b31cd"],
 " (dualises ports as well) and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["DiagramReverse",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/DiagrammaticComputation/ref/DiagramReverse"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"15ad144b-0a3c-4310-9889-264b0a93c4f7"],
 " (reverses port order)."
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"81469bda-c94e-4635-8fc6-c514c768a489"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

